{"id":"661527","name":"牛肉萝卜盅","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/661527/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"熟牛肉块","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"心里美萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"绿萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"6粒"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"心里美萝卜，绿萝卜分别洗净去皮，切成丁。","img":"images/661527/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"个炖蛊底部分别加入红、绿萝丁。","img":"images/661527/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"这个炖盅也装入同样食材。","img":"images/661527/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再添满红、绿萝卜丁。","img":"images/661527/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"也同样添加萝卜丁。","img":"images/661527/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"牛肉汤。","img":"images/661527/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"牛肉汤分别加入炖盅中。","img":"images/661527/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炖蛊中加入牛肉汤。","img":"images/661527/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"两个炖蛊同时放入高压锅中，压制10分钟。","img":"images/661527/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取出炖盅，加入枸杞点缀即可，牛肉鲜香、汤鲜味美。","img":"images/661527/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}